# Evoke's sacrifice is "its controller sacrifices it" (CR 702.74a): whoever controls the permanent as the trigger resolves,
# not the trigger's controller. Bot1 evokes Endurance (exiling Llanowar Elves). With its enters triggers on the stack, Bot2
# Giant Growths Old Man of the Sea (5/6) and takes the 3/4 Endurance with it (Bot2 has controlled Old Man since their turn
# began, CR 302.6). The evoke trigger resolves: Bot2 controls Endurance now and sacrifices it (CR 701.21a), into its
# owner's graveyard, Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Endurance
Forest x22

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Old Man of the Sea
Mox Emerald
Giant Growth
Island x14

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Old Man of the Sea.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Endurance.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Power = 5
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Endurance)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Endurance.Power = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Endurance
Bot2.Battlefield.Endurance = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Tapped = true
Exile = Llanowar Elves
